  "allowedFields": [
    "Build-Date",
    "Build-Date-UTC"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "Raw captures and exact inventory results remain mandatory",
    "Paths, types, modes, graph and output producers stay identical",
    "Only listed manifests may vary, and only both exact canonical UTC date values",
    "Every differing manifest and propagated source requires an EXECUTED producer in both arms",
    "Dates must lie inside their own recorded native invocation; changed cached dates fail closed",
    "Propagated manifests must be byte-identical to the declared source jar manifest",
    "All other manifest bytes, ZIP metadata, entry order and compressed payloads stay exact",
    "CRC, sizes and offsets may vary only as validated consequences of approved manifest bytes",
    "Unsupported archive forms, missing or duplicate fields, new paths and malformed data fail closed",
    "Freeze before fresh native/native validation and candidate correctness; calibration does not validate candidate acceptance"
  ],
